# Notebooks are committed WITH outputs so results render on GitHub, but the
# embedded base64 PNGs make textual diffs unreadable. `-diff` collapses them to
# "Binary files differ" without hiding them from GitHub's language stats
# (linguist-generated would erase the Jupyter Notebook bar we want to show).
*.ipynb -diff

# Bundled source data shouldn't skew language statistics.
data/*.csv linguist-vendored
